dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Features",
  "description": "Maps+ features: points, lines and polygons from the feature field.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map_1": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Feature rows",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup features.csv",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_html": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "Use the measure tool in the upper right corner to draw features (point, line or polygon) on the map. Upon completion, a **Feature Definition** can be copied and used with the `feature` field. Adjust the look and behavior of the feature with the following fields `featureColor`, `featureDescription`, `featureTooltip`, `featureLayer`, `featureWeight`, `featureStroke`, `featureFill`, `featureFillColor`, `featureFillOpacity`, `featureRadius`\n\nDefine the features with the `feature` field.\n\n![](/static/app/leaflet_maps_app/visualizations/maps-plus/contrib/images/feature-definition.png)\n\nOptionally, store the features in a lookup file and use `| append [|inputlookup feature-lookup.csv]` to load the features on map\n\n### Example Feature Search\n\n```spl\n| makeresults | eval feature=\"42.259016415705766,-87.99087524414064\", featureWeight=\"3\", featureColor=\"#5CBF5C\", featureDescription=\"point description\", featureTooltip=\"point tip\", featureFillOpacity=\"0.350\", featureFillColor=\"#f4f141\", featureFill=\"false\",featureStroke=\"true\", featureRadius=\"10\", featureLayer=\"point layer\", featureFillOpacity=\"1.0\"\n| append [| makeresults | eval feature=\"42.25946306970395,-87.99049168825151;42.25916530072335,-87.99044072628021;42.259145449407995,-87.98961728811265;42.259472995312414,-87.98967629671098;42.25946306970395,-87.99049168825151\", layerDescription=\"polygon layer\", featureTooltip=\"polygon tooltip\", featureDescription=\"polygon description\", featureLayer=\"polygon layer\", featureColor=\"#41dff4\", featureFillColor=\"#55f441\", featureFillOpacity=\"0.1\"]\n| append [| makeresults | eval feature=\"42.25895289132462,-87.99104690551759;42.25959408760995,-87.98937588930131\", layerDescription=\"line layer\", featureDescription=\"line description\", featureTooltip=\"line tooltip\", featureLayer=\"line layer\", featureColor=\"#f441d3\"]\n| table feature, layerDescription, tooltip, featureDescription, featureTooltip, featureColor, featureStroke, featureWeight, featureRadius, featureLayer, featureFillColor, featureFillOpacity\n```"
      }
    },
    "viz_map_1": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "feature, featureColor, featureDescription, featureTooltip, featureLayer, featureWeight, featureStroke, featureFill, featureFillColor, featureFillOpacity, featureRadius, layerPriority",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map_1"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldownAction": "dblclick",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "12",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.i18nLanguage": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "39.50",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-98.35",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "6",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "http://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/light_all/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathRenderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.renderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.useOpenFreeMap": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maplibreStylePreset": "dark"
      }
    },
    "viz_md_1": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "### Features from a lookup\n\n**What this shows** - Three features stored in a lookup: a one-point circle, a polygon and a two-point shape, each styled with its own colours, tooltip and layer.\n\n**The SPL**\n\n```spl\n| inputlookup features.csv\n```\n\n**How it works**\n\n1. `inputlookup features.csv` returns one row per shape; there is no latitude/longitude, only a `feature` string.\n2. `feature` is `lat,lon` points joined by `;`. One point draws a circle (`featureRadius` pixels), two or more draw a polygon, or a polyline when `featureFill=\"false\"`.\n3. The `feature*` columns style each shape; `featureLayer` and `layerPriority` put it in its own layer and set pane order. Blank lookup cells are treated as absent in classic dashboards, which means defaults apply.\n4. `measureTool=1` adds the measure tool; its output is a Feature Definition you can paste into the lookup. `cluster`, `mapCenter*` and `autoFitAndZoom=1` set the view.\n\n**Field formats and rules**\n\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `feature` | `lat,lon;lat,lon;...`, latitude first | One point = circle; two or more = polygon, or polyline when `featureFill=\"false\"`. A row with `feature` and no `latitude`/`longitude` draws only the shape. |\n| `featureColor` | CSS colour, default `#3388ff` | Stroke colour. |\n| `featureDescription` | HTML text | Click popup; escape any event text. |\n| `featureTooltip` | HTML text | Hover tooltip; escape any event text. |\n| `featureLayer` | text, default `feature` | Layer-control entry. First row wins for the layer label (`layerDescription`). |\n| `featureWeight` | integer, default 3 | Stroke width in pixels. |\n| `featureStroke` | `\"true\"` / `\"false\"`, default true | Only the string `\"true\"` is true; `\"1\"` or `\"yes\"` mean false. |\n| `featureFill` | `\"true\"` / `\"false\"`, default true | Same boolean rule. `\"false\"` turns a multi-point shape into a polyline. |\n| `featureFillColor` | CSS colour, default = `featureColor` | Fill colour. |\n| `featureFillOpacity` | 0 to 1, default 0.2 | Fill opacity. |\n| `featureRadius` | pixels, default 10 | One-point features only. |\n| `layerPriority` | integer | Pane order of the layer. |\n\n**Try it**\n\n- In the lookup, set `featureFill` to `false` on the two-point row: it becomes a line instead of a degenerate polygon.\n- Draw a shape with the measure tool, copy its Feature Definition into a new `feature` cell and give it a `featureLayer`.\n\n> **Studio note:** The lookup leaves `featureStroke` and `featureFill` blank on every row. On Maps+ 4.6.9 and earlier, Studio sends blanks as null, which reads as false, so polygons become lines (fixed in the unreleased 4.6.10; before that, fill them in the lookup or add `| fillnull value=\"true\" featureStroke featureFill`). The measure tool's output has not been verified in Studio.\n\n**Basemap:** this example uses keyless OpenFreeMap vector tiles (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1). CARTO basemaps need a free API key: see **Help > Basemaps & API keys** for how to get one and where to put it (**Map Tile Override**)."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "globalInputs": [],
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 1340,
          "display": "auto",
          "backgroundColor": "#000000"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_html",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 640
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map_1",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 640,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 700
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_md_1",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 640,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 700
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
